  "goodToKnow": "Beschneiden means to trim or prune (Hecken, Bäume beschneiden), to curtail (Rechte, Budgets, Freiheiten beschneiden) and to circumcise. After a 2012 Cologne court ruling questioned religious circumcision of boys, the Bundestag passed a law the same year explicitly permitting it under conditions. Die Beschneidung is pruning or circumcision. Irregular like schneiden: beschnitt, beschnitten."
